-- Subfields of the reals as sets of reals closed under the field
-- operations, their membership laws, the bridge to the bundled subring,
-- and the two bounds: every subfield contains the rationals and sits in ℝ.
-- Part of the Constructible blueprint.
-- Planned home: Algebra/Field/RealSubfield.
-- Copyright (c) 2026 Grant Passmore.
